  "created": "2026-05-15T00:48:30.79Z",
  "description": "Barcode Generator for RDLC reports library is a .NET barcode generator library for RDLC reports from KeepDynamic to encode, create, print QR Code, Data Matrix, PDF-417, Code 128, EAN/UPC and other 2d and 1d barcode symbologies. You can easily generate barcodes in the RDLC reports in ASP.NET web and Windows app.\n\nBarcode Generator SDK can be easily integrated and used in C#, VB.NET, ASP.NET Core, Framework, MVC, WinForms, WPF, console and desktop applications.\n\nSupported barcode formats :\n* QR Code (Styled QR Code, GS1 QR Code, Macro, Micro QR Code), \n* Data Matrix (GS1, Structure Append) and PDF-417 (Micro included)\n* Code 39, Code 128, GS1-128\n* EAN 8, EAN 13, UPC-A, UPC-E, +2, +5\n* Interleaved 2 of 5, ITF-14\n* And more\n\nBarcode Output : \n* Raster Image: bitmap (.bmp), gif, png, jpeg/jpg, tiff\n* Vector Image: SVG, EPS\n* Stream objects or binary data\n\nCompatible with :\n* .NET Standard 2.0\n* .NET 8, .NET 7, .NET 6, .NET 5\n* .NET Core 3.x, & 2.x\n* .NET Framework 4.6.1\n\nDocuments\n* How to : http://www.keepdynamic.com/barcoding/csharp-barcode-generator.shtml\n* Email : support@keepdynamic.com",
